{"2201910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Winds Of Arcana: Ruination", "steam_appid": 2201910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Community on Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/5f5d2af0b29b9172b209d5828bc6834d.avif?t=1786636345\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Ultimate Warrior Mage.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wield mighty weapons and unleash devastating magic as you grapple, glide, fight, and explore across a mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/c197c52ddec8ae514ad0a21a7bbc514f.poster.avif?t=1786636345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/c197c52ddec8ae514ad0a21a7bbc514f.webm?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/c197c52ddec8ae514ad0a21a7bbc514f.mp4?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Legendary Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Master Sword. The Lich Hammer. There are whispers of many more. Find them and their powers are yours: each with unique traits suiting a variety of different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/906aa584e41661eb04dd56625fe76c55.poster.avif?t=1786636345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/906aa584e41661eb04dd56625fe76c55.webm?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/906aa584e41661eb04dd56625fe76c55.mp4?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Ancient Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Crests are ancient magic items that hold the essence of long-forgotten warriors. Collect them to learn their power: and live your wildest battlemage fantasies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/7d5a7aca8592fefe401cf972e6e6c9d8.poster.avif?t=1786636345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/7d5a7aca8592fefe401cf972e6e6c9d8.webm?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/7d5a7aca8592fefe401cf972e6e6c9d8.mp4?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Lovingly Crafted Metroidvania World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grapple, Glide, Summon Platforms and more! Find Artifices to unlock the world and discover its deepest secrets. Experience the thrill of exploration with the challenge of platforming. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/1842db7e7a8ec9aff54242134e25820e.poster.avif?t=1786636345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/1842db7e7a8ec9aff54242134e25820e.webm?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/1842db7e7a8ec9aff54242134e25820e.mp4?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully-voiced story. Every line of dialogue is performed by a talented cast of voice actors.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living world, where each biome has its own theme, lore, dangers, and challenges.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected map. Explore as you wish. Gain abilities to unlock areas. Find shortcuts, hidden passages, and more.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests, quests everywhere! Find characters to help and mysteries to solve throughout the world. But beware: your choices have consequences.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memorable boss fights. Bosses will test you to your limits. Beating them will require skill, tactical-thinking, and unlocking the full potential of your weapons and powers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your build. Mix and match various weapons and different powers to create a build that reflects your playstyle. Each unique weapon has stats that can be unlocked by defeating enemies and upgrading at the vendor.</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Ultimate Warrior Mage.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wield mighty weapons and unleash devastating magic as you grapple, glide, fight, and explore across a mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/c197c52ddec8ae514ad0a21a7bbc514f.poster.avif?t=1786636345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/c197c52ddec8ae514ad0a21a7bbc514f.webm?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/c197c52ddec8ae514ad0a21a7bbc514f.mp4?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Legendary Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Master Sword. The Lich Hammer. There are whispers of many more. Find them and their powers are yours: each with unique traits suiting a variety of different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/906aa584e41661eb04dd56625fe76c55.poster.avif?t=1786636345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/906aa584e41661eb04dd56625fe76c55.webm?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/906aa584e41661eb04dd56625fe76c55.mp4?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Ancient Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Crests are ancient magic items that hold the essence of long-forgotten warriors. Collect them to learn their power: and live your wildest battlemage fantasies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/7d5a7aca8592fefe401cf972e6e6c9d8.poster.avif?t=1786636345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/7d5a7aca8592fefe401cf972e6e6c9d8.webm?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/7d5a7aca8592fefe401cf972e6e6c9d8.mp4?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Lovingly Crafted Metroidvania World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grapple, Glide, Summon Platforms and more! Find Artifices to unlock the world and discover its deepest secrets. Experience the thrill of exploration with the challenge of platforming. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/1842db7e7a8ec9aff54242134e25820e.poster.avif?t=1786636345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/1842db7e7a8ec9aff54242134e25820e.webm?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/1842db7e7a8ec9aff54242134e25820e.mp4?t=1786636345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully-voiced story. Every line of dialogue is performed by a talented cast of voice actors.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living world, where each biome has its own theme, lore, dangers, and challenges.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected map. Explore as you wish. Gain abilities to unlock areas. Find shortcuts, hidden passages, and more.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests, quests everywhere! Find characters to help and mysteries to solve throughout the world. But beware: your choices have consequences.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memorable boss fights. Bosses will test you to your limits. Beating them will require skill, tactical-thinking, and unlocking the full potential of your weapons and powers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your build. Mix and match various weapons and different powers to create a build that reflects your playstyle. Each unique weapon has stats that can be unlocked by defeating enemies and upgrading at the vendor.</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Discover the secrets of a sundered world as you help Aryn save his comrades in this story-rich, fully-voiced, 2.5D action-platformer. Fight terrible dangers and explore ancient mysteries as Aryn uncovers the forces that forge his destiny.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/4868570cdc04c552fb25e6fe8102e3153d9b2c92/header.jpg?t=1786636345", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/a3ee67993dae2637804cdd7f1a2b89d43f444c92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786636345", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/a3ee67993dae2637804cdd7f1a2b89d43f444c92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786636345", "website": "https://www.brewedgames.com/winds-of-arcana-ruination", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8/10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 10th Gen or AMD equivelent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GeForce 960 or AMD Equivelent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.13.6+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><str